# BUZZBOLT: wave 3's boss, the Queen Tick, can be beaten: rings that bounce
# off the bottom of the screen, fans, and bursts once she is hurt. Flown
# by the demo player in the shieldbug.
game buzzbolt
# the opening: A skips it
press A
press A
wait 10
press RIGHT
press A
wait 10
cheat lives 3
cheat wave 3
cheat boss
waituntil boss_count == 1 200
expect boss_kind == 9
waituntil rings_bounced > 0 400
botuntil boss_dead == 1 9000
expect boss_count == 0
expect drops >= 3
waituntil state == 4 400
waituntil state == 3 400
expect wave == 4
